From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:58:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner A733 USB3 combo PHY

The USB3 controller of the Allwinner A733 reaches its Type-C connector
through the first combo PHY of the SERDES block. Enable its driver as a
module.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the kernel builds the
driver as a module, and modprobe phy-sun60i-a733-combophy succeeds.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 45b1186374a9..8547244e2a97 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1761,6 +1761,7 @@ CONFIG_PHY_SNPS_EUSB2=m
 CONFIG_PHY_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN4I_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_USB2=m
+CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_COMBO=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_TORRENT=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY_RX=m
